  "prefLabel": "Plc 2003.04 Application for Initial Voluntary Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2003.04 Application for Initial Voluntary Certification. An individual who is not already certified as a CHW in New Hampshire shall apply for initial certification by complying with Plc 304.01, subject to the following:\n\n(a) On or with the profession-specific supplement required by Plc 304.01(a)(3), the applicant shall provide the information and documentation specified in Plc 2003.05;\n\n(b) No criminal background check shall be required; and\n\n(c) The fee shall be the application processing and licensing fee specified in Plc 1002.54, provided that an applicant who is active military or a military spouse shall not pay the fee.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35 (formerly Plc 2003.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
